[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_1A_CATAPULT]
Individual Catapult

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_1A_CATAPULT_desc]
As we all know, flying objects need to have a lift greater than gravity (huh?) to stay in the air. Therefore, if you throw stones at the enemy’s aircraft, the total weight of the aircraft will increase after they catch the stones. If the lift remains the same, the aircraft will descend, thus we can shoot down the enemy aircraft.

§g“What if they throw away the stones they catch?”§!
“That’s the clever part. We throw apple pies instead of stones! They will definitely eat them and not throw them away!”

§g“Another question... How do our aircraft take off with those stones or apple pies?”§!
“Easy! We don’t need to load them, because our enemy will throw them at us!”

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_1A_CATAPULT]
单兵投石车

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_1A_CATAPULT_desc]
众所周知，飞行的物体需要向上的浮力大于重力(嗯?)才能保持在空中，所以，如果向敌军的飞行器上投掷石头，他们接住石头以后，飞行器总重量就会增大，浮力不变的情况下，就会下降，这样就可以击落敌机了。

§g“那如果他们把接住的石头扔掉怎么办？”§!
“这就是巧妙之处所在了，我们投掷苹果派而不是石头！他们一定会吃掉，而不舍得扔掉！”

§g“还有一个问题... 我们的飞行器怎么载着那些石头或者苹果派起飞呢？”§!
“简单！我们不用装载，因为敌军会朝我们丢！”
